    {
      "id": "3ff88a6a-2766-46f9-a03f-b28a95173e69",
      "name": "Setup and operating contract",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        950
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Booking policy and recovery\nSelect Supabase, Google Calendar, Gmail and Pushover credentials. Set CALENDAR_ID (defaults primary), BOOKING_TIMEZONE (defaults Africa/Cairo), PUSHOVER_USER_KEY and SUPABASE_URL. Inputs: contact_id, preferred_date (YYYY-MM-DD or ISO datetime with offset), optional deal_id. Calling this workflow means the prospect requested booking near that preference.\n\nSlots: next five Monday-Friday business days including today, 09:00-17:00 in BOOKING_TIMEZONE, 30 minutes, at least 30 minutes notice. Holidays are excluded only if blocked on Calendar. Final free-busy is rechecked. Event IDs derive from the deal UUID; a rerun finds the existing event before attempting another. Run one booking execution at a time per calendar: Google Calendar free-busy plus insert is not atomic across different deals. Failed external writes require inspecting Calendar before retry.\n\nCRM advances only after a real event exists. Errors after creation return booking_created and event_id. Replayed existing events are reconciled in CRM without re-sending confirmation; confirmation_sent=false on replay means no email sent in this execution, not that no prior email exists. Google Calendar sends attendee invitations; Gmail sends the separate confirmation.",
        "width": 1250,
        "height": 370
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "88faecf4-2c28-4a72-9ed0-ec6b47f846fa",
      "name": "Catch workflow failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        2440,
        960
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const raw=$input.first().json; const error=raw.error; const message=typeof error==='string'?error:error?.message || raw.message || 'Workflow execution failed'; let extra={};try{if($('Prepare booking result').isExecuted){const b=$('Prepare booking result').first().json;extra={booking_created:true,event_id:b.event_id,booked_slot:b.booked_slot,deal_id:b.deal_id,confirmation_sent:$('Gmail send demo confirmation').isExecuted && Boolean($('Gmail send demo confirmation').first().json.id)};}}catch{} \nreturn [{json:{success:false,error_message:String(message).slice(0,2000),workflow_name:$workflow.name,node_name:error?.node?.name || raw.node?.name || 'Handled workflow failure',execution_id:String($execution.id),speech:'I could not finish that request. A team member can help.',...extra}}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "3cf22ad2-454d-4b43-93a3-daf91d107322",
